* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* RMSRCP -  Copy Lines of Source into DB File and start first
*           CreateActiveReport Order
*
* Maintenance
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999)  ...
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
* mrs 93-01-05            created
* gw  94-06-23 s(999999)  use od-dbid and od-fnr
* mrs 95-05-29 s(225717)  retry loading data, if possible
* gw  96-01-05 s(239209)  store cleanup order, source no longer needed
*                         CMASPOOL only !
* gw  97-01-14 s(260199)  no cleanup in container file
* jwo 97-03-10 p(161209) copy   bs2000 files y/n
* jwo 97-06-02 p(162733)  extended spool attributes were lost
*                         during copy of BS2000 files
* jvd 98-09-10 p(164220) NOM141ÖNAT23
* sju 00-03-27 p(191368) monitor multitasking
* fhi 00-08-24 QA03      Use NAT23006 for error values
* fhi 00-09-25 s(196560) Add Unix file support
* fhi 00-09-28 QA04      Correct CE7461
* fhi 02-09-25 p(218246) Monitor error recovery
* sju 02-11-04 NOM221    Long records (Jes2 only)
* sju 03-01-29 p(232455) Don't write messages for retryable errors
* sju     2003-06-26 p(230407) Correct setting of retry info in orders
* sju     2003-06-30 p(230407) Multiple containers don't work
* sju 04-02-12 p(250127) Better reporting of errors
* sju 04-11-29 nom31     restow for changed NRM-ORDER
* sju 04-12-06 NOM31     Add date and time (tenths of second) to trace
* sju 05-02-08 NOM31     Long records not just for jes2
* fhi 05-04-19 NOM31107  Support 7-byte job numbers
* fhi     2005-12-05 P272727   Avoid NAT6223 under Unix
* fhi     2007-07-12 NOM3202   C-NATERR changed, NAD23006 is obsolete.
* fhi     2007-07-31 NRT2422   Support direct input
* sju 07-12-11 p(285832) Zombie create-ar orders if load fails
* fhi     2009-05-26 N3463     Extend metadata for OPO
* fhi     2010-09-21 NOMALL-97 Use no more C-NATERR but C-NATERN instead
* fhi     2010-10-12 NOMALL-97 Use trace levels, use XXRLOG
* raya    2012-08-21 NOMALL-78 disable long records
* fhi     2012-08-24 NOMALL-1004 Add report formatting
* fhi     2012-08-27 NOMALL-1004 Add report formatting, old tags remvd.
* fhi     2012-11-07 NOMALL-1004 Same
* fhi     2012-11-09 NOMALL-1143 Adding performance measuring.
* fhi     2013-03-06 NOMALL-1004 Correct report formatting
* fhi     2013-03-14 NOMALL-1004 Use correct source pointers,set attrb.
* fhi     2013-03-23 NOMALL-1004 Same.
* fhi     2013-03-27 NOMALL-1004 Same.
* xsetggr 2013-06-04 NOMALL-1227 improve trace info
* raya    2013-07-22 NOMALL-1215 avoid report not found when destination
* fhi     2013-09-12 NOMALL-1215 Continuing corrections
* fhi     2013-09-19 NOMALL-1215 Continuing corrections
* fhi     2013-09-23 NOMALL-1004B NOMALL-1004 partly backouted to avoid
*                               Ü side effects causing NOMALL-1215
*                               Ü Will be re-established for NOM 3.4.2
* SU1     2013-09-10 NOMALL-82 new class: activate error
* fhi     2014-03-03 NOMALL-1363 Get cat cate into trace messages
* SU2     2014-08-14 NOMALL-1447 remove unused vars
* fhi     2014-09-18 NOMALL-1488 Keep extended attributes
* SU3     2014-11-17 NOMALL-1450 fill fields for Adabas Vista
* fhi     2015-05-12 NOMALL-1585 Improve waiting for locked files
* SU4     2015-08-11 NOMALL-1690 XXHASH restructure
* SU5     2015-12-30 NOMALL-1722 XXHASH-P changed->recat
* SU6     2016-01-20 NOMALL-1802 do not update Adabas Vista fields
* fhi     2016-08-01 NOMALL-1748 Backout Report Formatting
* SU7     2016-08-11 NOM 3.5: remove unused code
* fhi     2016-11-08 NOMALL-1961 Prepare several COPY monitor-tasks
* fhi     2016-11-15 NOMALL-1961 Use new task IDs
* fhi     2017-01-05 NOMALL-1961 Improve err handling (return to ERROR)
* fhi     2017-01-11 NOMALL-1961 Change descriptor of NRM-ORDER
* fhi     2017-01-18 NOMALL-1916 Use binary NPR RECORD* fields
* fhi     2017-01-26 NOMALL-1961 Wake correct monitor task
* fhi     2017-03-31 NOMALL-2009 Improve RDC handling
* fhi     2018-03-13 NOMALL-1918 Correct multinode behavior, no tags
* fhi     2018-05-15 NOMALL-1961 Improve err handling
* fhi     2018-08-06 NOMALL-2135 Use internal node id in orders
* fhi     2018-09-06 NOMALL-2141 Correct handling of REP-FORMAT
* SU8     2018-10-11             G-SOURCE-ID -> local field
* fhi     2018-12-14 NOM 3.5     Improve CPU measures, no tags
* fhi     2019-06-05 NOMALL-2267 More details if '0 records loaded'
* fhi     2019-06-12 NOMALL-2267 Expand identity in message 4205
* fhi     2019-06-14 NOMALL-2267 Still minor errors
* fhi     2019-06-19 NOMALL-2267 Better trace. Still 0 records appears
* fhi     2019-06-28 NOMALL-2267 same
* fhi     2019-07-02 NOMALL-2287 Several copy tasks work on same order
* fhi     2019-08-14 NOMALL-2294 Introduce TRACE-ORDER in JOBCARDs
* fhi     2019-08-19 NOMALL-2294 Stamp must be resetted to ' ' always
* BLI     2019-09-24 NOMALL-2294 NPR/Broker fails, ET, no DELETE
* BLI     2019-10-18 NOMALL-2244 reduce messages during retry
* BLI     2020-02-17 NOMALL-2294 correct stamp, OD-LOAD status, BS2
* SU9     2020-06-22 NOMALL-2349 show full msg
* SU10    2020-11-10 NOMALL-2440 recat for VMONIT-L
* BLI     2021-08-09 NOMALL-2470 trace incomplete orders on BS2
* BLI     2021-10-25 NOMALL-2498 error handling, update get-next-order
* BLI1    2023-06-22 NOMALL-2635 Scan product with error number in text
* BLI2    2023-10-04 NOMALL-2636 Daily and automatic cleanup corrections
* BLI3    2024-03-18 NOMALL-2664 Unix file deleted too early
************************************************************************
*
DEFINE DATA GLOBAL USING MONIT-GL
INDEPENDENT
1 +G-CLEANUP-SPOOL           (L)
1 +G-BS2-COPY                (L)
1 +CMRDC                     (A1)
1 +NOD-CURRENT-ERROR-CLASS   (A1)
1 +NOD-CURRENT-INTERNAL-ID   (P11)
1 +NOD-CURRENT-NAME          (A16)
1 +TRACE-ORDER               (A1)
*
LOCAL USING RMOD---L
LOCAL USING RMODTY-E
LOCAL USING RMSR---E
LOCAL USING RMSR---L
LOCAL USING RMSPL--L
LOCAL USING RLOG-L
/*SU10 LOCAL USING VMONIT-L
LOCAL USING RMTASK-E
LOCAL USING NOMWK--P
LOCAL USING NOMFNC-E
*
LOCAL
1 NRM-MONITOR VIEW OF NRM-MONITOR  /*SU10
  2 M-MAX-RETRIES (N3.0)
  2 M-RETRY-INTERVAL (N5.0)
1 SOURCE VIEW OF NRM-SOURCE
  2 SR-ID
  2 SR-TYPE
  2 SR-CC-TYPE
  2 SR-REMOTE-CODEPAGE
  2 SR-MONITOR-ID
  2 SR-NUMBER-OF-LINES
  2 SR-RECORD-LENGTH
  2 SR-RECEIPT-STAMP
  2 SR-CONTROL-FLAG
  2 SR-ATTRIBUTES-IDENT
  2 SR-SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES
  2 SR-SPOOL-ATTR-EXTENDED   (1:120)
  2 SR-OBJECT-TYPE
  2 SR-OBJECT-TIME
1 UPDATE-ORDER VIEW OF NRM-ORDER
  2 OD-ID
  2 OD-TYPE
  2 OD-SOURCE-ID
  2 OD-MONITOR-ID
  2 OD-TIME-PROCESSED
  2 OD-TIME-CREATED
  2 OD-TIME-SCHEDULED
  2 OD-STATISTICS
  2 OD-PARAMETER             (1)
  2 REDEFINE OD-PARAMETER
    3 OD-IDENT               (A8)
    3 OD-FILLER1             (A17)
    3 OD-DBID                (N3)
    3 OD-FNR                 (N3)
    3 OD-RETRY-COUNT         (N3)
    3 OD-DBID-N5             (N5)
    3 OD-FNR-N5              (N5)
    3 OD-REP-FORMAT          (A1)
  2 OD-ERROR-CODE
  2 OD-ERROR-TEXT
  2 OD-MAX-RETRIES
  2 OD-RETRY-INTERVAL
  2 OD-INTERNAL-NODE-ID      (P15)
  2 OD-RETRY-NUMBER
1 ORDER VIEW OF NRM-ORDER
  2 OD-USER-ID
  2 OD-TIME-CREATED
  2 OD-ID
  2 OD-MONITOR-ID
  2 OD-TYPE
  2 OD-TIME-SCHEDULED
  2 OD-PARAMETER             (1)
  2 REDEFINE OD-PARAMETER
    3 OD-IDENT               (A8)
    3 OD-FILLER1             (A17)
    3 OD-DBID                (N3)
    3 OD-FNR                 (N3)
    3 OD-RETRY-COUNT         (N3)
    3 OD-DBID-N5             (N5)
    3 OD-FNR-N5              (N5)
    3 OD-REP-FORMAT          (A1)
    3 OD-REPNAME             (A25)
  2 OD-SOURCE-ID             (P10)
  2 OD-MAX-RETRIES           (N3)
  2 OD-RETRY-INTERVAL        (N5)
  2 OD-INTERNAL-NODE-ID      (P15)
*
1 #SR-ID-SAVE                (P10)
1 LFILE                      (L)
1 #LFILE-RC                  (I4)
1 #LFILE-OLDDBID             (P5)
1 #LFILE-OLDFILE             (P5)
1 #LFILE-NEWDBID             (P5)
1 #LFILE-NEWFILE             (P5)
1 #TARGET-DBID               (N5)
1 #TARGET-FNR                (N5)
1 ORDER-FOUND                (L)
1 #IDENT                     (A25)
1 #ID                        (P10)
1 #SR-ID                     (P10)
1 #RECORD-LENGTH             (N3)
1 #NUMBER-OF-LINES           (P10)
1 #OD-TYPE-TIME              (A9)
1 REDEFINE #OD-TYPE-TIME
  2 #OD-TYPE                 (B2)
  2 #OD-TIME                 (T)
1 #STATISTICS                (A250)
1 RECORDS-STORED             (L)
1 RETRY-POSSIBLE             (L)
1 RETRY-ALLOWED              (L)
1 #PREV-TARGET-DBID          (N5)
1 #PREV-TARGET-FNR           (N5)
1 #ERROR-OBJECT-NAME         (A60)
1 #RESET-ERC                 (L)
1 #UPDATE-AR-ORDERS          (L)
1 #ET-COUNT                  (I2)
1 #TRACING                   (L)
1 P-TRACE                    (I2)
1 RMSETTIM
  2 FUNCTION                 (A1)
  2 ERC                      (N4)
  2 MSG                      (A250)
  2 TIME                     (I4)
1 #CATDATE                   (A19)
1 #SOURCE-ID                 (P10)
1 #P-FILE-NAME               (A250)
1 #LINE                      (I4)
1 #ISN                       (P10)
1 #ADA-RC                    (N4)
1 #TYPE-I                    (I2)
1 #UPD-CURRENT-LOAD-ORDER    (L)    /* NOMALL-2294 BLI
1 #G-TASK-NUMBER             (N3)   /* NOMALL-2294 BLI start
1 REDEFINE #G-TASK-NUMBER
  2 #G-TASK-NUMBER-BEGIN     (A2)
  2 #G-TASK-NUMBER-STMP      (A1)   /* NOMALL-2294 BLI end
1 #MONITOR-ID                (A20)
*
1 #UNIX-FILE-DELETE          (L)    /* BLI3
*
END-DEFINE
*
************************************************************************
* Main line
************************************************************************
*
FORMAT LS=100
*
IF G-TRACE GE *LEVEL AND G-TRACE-SET = SCAN ('COPY')
  #TRACING := TRUE
  P-TRACE  := G-TRACE
  RMSETTIM.FUNCTION := 'S'
  PERFORM RMSETTIM-SETTIME RMSETTIM
  PERFORM XXCATAL-GET-CATDATE #CATDATE
  COMPRESS 'Start' *PROGRAM 'cataloged at'  #CATDATE TO G-TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
END-IF
IF +TRACE-ORDER = ' ' /* not yet determined from jobcards
  PERFORM RMGTRACE-GET-SETTINGS
END-IF
INCLUDE CMRDC
*
#MONITOR-ID := F#MONITOR-TASK-ID1 (<>)
FIND (1) NRM-MONITOR WITH M-MONITOR-ID = #MONITOR-ID
END-FIND
PERFORM GET-LFILE
IF G-NATRP-ERC NE 0
  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-LOG
  END TRANSACTION                /* NOMALL-2294 BLI
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
*
MAIN. REPEAT
  RESET G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT G-ORDER-ID  G-ORDER-ISN #SOURCE-ID
  RESET RECORDS-STORED #NUMBER-OF-LINES #UPD-CURRENT-LOAD-ORDER
    #UPDATE-AR-ORDERS #UNIX-FILE-DELETE                           /*BLI3
  PERFORM GET-NEXT-ORDER
  IF NOT ORDER-FOUND
    ESCAPE BOTTOM (MAIN.)
  END-IF
*
  DECIDE FOR EVERY CONDITION
* WHEN G-NATRP-ERC = 0 PERFORM SET-LFILE              /* BLI NOMALL-2294
* WHEN G-NATRP-ERC = 0 PERFORM READ-SOURCE-ATTRIBUTES /* BLI NOMALL-2294
    WHEN G-NATRP-ERC = 0 PERFORM GET-SOURCE-TEXT-ID
    WHEN G-NATRP-ERC = 0 PERFORM COPY-SOURCE
    WHEN G-NATRP-ERC = 0 PERFORM UPDATE-CURRENT-SOURCES
    WHEN NONE IGNORE
  END-DECIDE
  G-CYCLE-WAS-IDLE := FALSE
  PERFORM UPDATE-CURRENT-ORDER
  IF #TRACING
    COMPRESS 'Copy result:' G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT TO G-TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
  END-IF
*
  IF #UNIX-FILE-DELETE         /* BLI3 delete now the unix file
    CALLNAT 'RMDELX-N' SOURCE.SR-SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES G-NATRP-ERC
      G-NATRP-ERT P-TRACE
  END-IF
  IF #TRACING
    COMPRESS 'Delete' #SPOOL-UNIX-FILE-NAME G-NATRP-ERC-A G-NATRP-ERT
      TO G-TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
  END-IF
*
  NOMWK-TASK-TYPE := EQU-CREATE-REPORTS
  CALLNAT NOM-WAKE-MONITOR NOMWK-NOMVERS NOMWK-PARMS (*)
END-REPEAT
*
PERFORM REFRESH-LFILE
*
IF #TRACING
  RMSETTIM.FUNCTION := 'G'
  PERFORM RMSETTIM-SETTIME RMSETTIM
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' RMSETTIM.MSG
  G-TRACE-MSG := 'End'
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
  END TRANSACTION
END-IF
*
************************************************************************
* End of main line (now subroutines):
************************************************************************
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE GET-NEXT-ORDER
************************************************************************
RESET ORDER-FOUND
#OD-TYPE := OD-LOAD-SOURCE
RESET #OD-TIME
*
IF #TRACING
  COMPRESS 'Get next order' #OD-TYPE #OD-TIME TO G-TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
END-IF
*
SET GLOBALS WH=OFF
FNDOD. READ ORDER BY OD-TYPE-TIME FROM #OD-TYPE-TIME
  RESET G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT                /* NOMALL-2498
  IF OD-TYPE NE #OD-TYPE OR OD-TIME-SCHEDULED  > *TIMX
**  BACKOUT TRANSACTION                        /* NOMALL-2244
    ESCAPE BOTTOM
  END-IF
  IF +TRACE-ORDER = 'Y' /* TRACE-ORDER found in jobcards
    #TYPE-I := ORDER.OD-TYPE
    COMPRESS 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER *PROGRAM
      'Got next order:' ORDER.OD-ID '- type' #TYPE-I
      '- created'   ORDER.OD-TIME-CREATED
      '- scheduled' ORDER.OD-TIME-SCHEDULED
      '- retry #'   ORDER.OD-RETRY-COUNT TO G-TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
  END-IF
  #ISN := *ISN(FNDOD.)
/* Use GETHOLD because the 'SHARED HOLD' and 'SKIP RECORDS IN HOLD'
/* clauses of the READ statement are not compatible to Natural Unix Ü
  CALLNAT 'GETHOLD' G-NATRP-DBID G-NATRP-FNR #ISN 'BS' #ADA-RC
  IF #TRACING
    COMPRESS 'Got order' OD-ID 'with lock rc:' #ADA-RC 'ISN:' #ISN
      TO G-TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
  END-IF
*
  IF #ADA-RC = 145          /* from GETHOLD, see above
    IF +TRACE-ORDER = 'Y' /* TRACE-ORDER found in jobcards
      #TYPE-I := ORDER.OD-TYPE
      COMPRESS 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER *PROGRAM
        ORDER.OD-ID 'type'  #TYPE-I 'in hold. Skipping' TO G-TRACE-MSG
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
    END-IF
    ESCAPE TOP              /* 145 in GETHOLD
  END-IF
*
  DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION
    WHEN OD-DBID-N5 > 0
      #TARGET-DBID := OD-DBID-N5
      #TARGET-FNR  := OD-FNR-N5
    WHEN OD-DBID    > 0
      #TARGET-DBID := OD-DBID
      #TARGET-FNR  := OD-FNR
      OD-DBID-N5   := OD-DBID
      OD-FNR-N5    := OD-FNR
      RESET OD-DBID OD-FNR
    WHEN NONE IGNORE
  END-DECIDE
  PERFORM SET-LFILE
  IF G-NATRP-ERC NE 0
    IF #TRACING                         /* BLI NOMALL-2470
      COMPRESS 'SET LFILE error' #LFILE-RC #TARGET-DBID #TARGET-FNR
        TO G-TRACE-MSG
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
    END-IF
    ESCAPE TOP
  END-IF
*
  PERFORM READ-SOURCE-ATTRIBUTES
*
  IF #TRACING
    IF G-NATRP-ERC = 0
      COMPRESS 'Spool type is' #SPOOL-TYPE TO G-TRACE-MSG
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      G-TRACE-MSG := 'Source properties:'
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      DECIDE ON FIRST VALUE OF #SPOOL-TYPE
        VALUE SEQUENTIAL-FILE-UNIX
          COMPRESS '- node:' #SPOOL-UNIX-NODE-NAME
            '- user:' #SPOOL-UNIX-USERID
            '- path:' #SPOOL-UNIX-PATH
            '- file:' #SPOOL-UNIX-FILE-NAME
            '- DBID:' #SPOOL-UNIX-CONTAINER-DBID
            '- FNR:'  #SPOOL-UNIX-CONTAINER-FNR TO G-TRACE-MSG
        VALUE DIRECT-INPUT
          COMPRESS '- ID:'   #SPOOL-DI-ST-ID
            '- RPC:'  #SPOOL-DI-RPC-SERVER
            '- user:' #SPOOL-DI-USERID
            '- path:' #SPOOL-DI-PATH
            '- file:' #SPOOL-DI-FILENAME
            '- type:' #SPOOL-DI-FILETYPE
            '- DBID:' #SPOOL-DI-CONTAINER-DBID
            '- FNR:'  #SPOOL-DI-CONTAINER-FNR
            '- size:' #SPOOL-DI-SIZE TO G-TRACE-MSG
        NONE
          G-TRACE-MSG := #SPOOL-ATTRIB
      END-DECIDE
    ELSE
      COMPRESS G-NATRP-ERC 'Order id' OD-ID 'did not find source'
        OD-SOURCE-ID TO G-TRACE-MSG
    END-IF
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
  END-IF
*
  IF G-NATRP-ERC EQ 0       /* found source    BLI NOMALL-2498
    SET GLOBALS WH=ON
* NOMALL-2294 BLI check if another copy task already works on it
    #G-TASK-NUMBER := G-TASK-NUMBER
    IF (#SPOOL-TYPE = SEQUENTIAL-FILE-UNIX OR = SEQUENTIAL-FILE-BS2)
        AND SR-RECEIPT-STAMP NE 'S'           /* has not been scanned
        AND SR-RECEIPT-STAMP NE #G-TASK-NUMBER-STMP
      IF #TRACING
       COMPRESS 'Source of this order rejected, stamp:' SR-RECEIPT-STAMP
          TO G-TRACE-MSG
        PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      END-IF
      IF +TRACE-ORDER = 'Y' /* TRACE-ORDER found in jobcards
        #TYPE-I := ORDER.OD-TYPE
        COMPRESS 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER *PROGRAM
          'Order' ORDER.OD-ID '- type' #TYPE-I
          'skipped, wrong stamp' SR-RECEIPT-STAMP
          '- created'   ORDER.OD-TIME-CREATED
          '- scheduled' ORDER.OD-TIME-SCHEDULED
          '- retry #'   ORDER.OD-RETRY-COUNT TO G-TRACE-MSG
        PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      END-IF
      ESCAPE TOP
    END-IF
  END-IF
*
  GETOD. GET ORDER *ISN(FNDOD.) /* Read again with hold
  IF NOT(OD-INTERNAL-NODE-ID =0 OR=+NOD-CURRENT-INTERNAL-ID)
    SET GLOBALS WH=OFF
    ESCAPE TOP
  END-IF
*
  G-ORDER-ID   := OD-ID
  G-ORDER-ISN  := *ISN (FNDOD.)
  #SOURCE-ID   := OD-SOURCE-ID
  #IDENT := F#GETIDENT(<OD-IDENT,OD-FILLER1>)
*
  IF G-NATRP-ERC EQ 0                   /* NOMALL-2498 BLI
    OD-TYPE       := OD-LOAD-SOURCE-IN-PROCESS
  ELSE                      /* did not find source
* set it here also, we need #UPDATE-AR-ORDERS in UPDATE-CURRENT-ORDER
    OD-TYPE       := OD-LOAD-SOURCE-FAILED
  END-IF
*
  OD-MONITOR-ID := G-MONITOR-ID
  UPDATE (GETOD.)
  END OF TRANSACTION
  ORDER-FOUND   := TRUE
  IF #TRACING
    G-TRACE-MSG := ORDER.OD-TYPE
    COMPRESS 'Update order record with OD-PARAMETER:'
      ORDER.OD-PARAMETER (1) 'TYPE:' G-TRACE-MSG 'MONITOR-ID:'
      ORDER.OD-MONITOR-ID 'USER-ID:' ORDER.OD-USER-ID TO G-TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
    IF G-NATRP-ERC EQ 0                   /* NOMALL-2498 BLI
      COMPRESS 'SOURCE-ID:' ORDER.OD-SOURCE-ID
        'TIME-CREATED:'   ORDER.OD-TIME-CREATED
        'TIME-SCHEDULED:' ORDER.OD-TIME-SCHEDULED
        'MAX-RETRIES:'    ORDER.OD-MAX-RETRIES
        'RETRY-INTERVAL:' ORDER.OD-RETRY-INTERVAL TO G-TRACE-MSG
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
    END-IF
  END-IF
  IF G-NATRP-ERC EQ 0                   /* NOMALL-2498 BLI
    IF OD-RETRY-COUNT GE OD-MAX-RETRIES   /* NOMALL-2294 BLI
      RETRY-ALLOWED := FALSE
      IF +TRACE-ORDER = 'Y' /* TRACE-ORDER found in jobcards
        COMPRESS 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER *PROGRAM
          'Retry set to disallowed.' TO G-TRACE-MSG
        PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      END-IF
    ELSE
      RETRY-ALLOWED := TRUE
      IF +TRACE-ORDER = 'Y' /* TRACE-ORDER found in jobcards
        COMPRESS 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER *PROGRAM
          'Retry set to allowed.' TO G-TRACE-MSG
        PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      END-IF
    END-IF
  END-IF
  ESCAPE BOTTOM (FNDOD.)
END-READ
SET GLOBALS WH=ON
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* GET-NEXT-ORDER
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE READ-SOURCE-ATTRIBUTES
************************************************************************
FNDSR. FIND SOURCE WITH SR-ID = ORDER.OD-SOURCE-ID
  IF NO RECORDS FOUND
    G-NATRP-ERC := 0005
    COMPRESS 'Source' ORDER.OD-SOURCE-ID  'not found'
      'of order' ORDER.OD-ID  TO  G-NATRP-ERT
    ESCAPE BOTTOM (FNDSR.)
  END-NOREC
  #SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES := SR-SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES      /* BLI NOMALL-2294
  IF SR-TYPE = SEQUENTIAL-FILE-UNIX
    #SOURCE-ATTRIBUTES := SR-ATTRIBUTES-IDENT
    +NOD-CURRENT-NAME  := #UNIX-NODE-NAME
  END-IF
END-FIND
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* READ-SOURCE-ATTRIBUTES
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE UPDATE-CURRENT-ORDER
************************************************************************
IF #UPD-CURRENT-LOAD-ORDER EQ TRUE /* already done NOMALL-2294 BLI
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
UPDOD. FIND UPDATE-ORDER WITH OD-ID = G-ORDER-ID
  DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION
    WHEN G-NATRP-ERC = 0
      OD-TYPE := OD-LOAD-SOURCE-OK
      RESET  OD-SOURCE-ID
      OD-TIME-PROCESSED := *TIMX
      OD-STATISTICS            := #STATISTICS
      PERFORM WRITE-LOAD-LOG-RECORD              /* NOMALL-2244
* NOMALL-2294 dedicated errors first, retry defaults only
    WHEN G-NATRP-ERC = 2036          /* 'file not found' not recoverable
        OR (G-NATRP-ERC = 5 AND G-NATRP-ERT = SCAN('SAT1114')) /* BLI1
      RESET RETRY-POSSIBLE
      OD-TYPE           := OD-LOAD-SOURCE-FAILED
      OD-ERROR-CODE     := G-NATRP-ERC
      OD-ERROR-TEXT     := G-NATRP-ERT
      OD-TIME-PROCESSED := *TIMX
      OD-STATISTICS     := #STATISTICS
      #UPDATE-AR-ORDERS := TRUE
      PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-LOG
    WHEN G-NATRP-ERC = 9997   /* skip
      IF OD-TYPE = OD-LOAD-SOURCE-IN-PROCESS    /* NOMALL-2294
        OD-TYPE := OD-LOAD-SOURCE
      END-IF
      RESET RETRY-POSSIBLE
* NOMALL-2294 BLI end
    WHEN OD-RETRY-NUMBER LT OD-MAX-RETRIES AND RETRY-POSSIBLE
    AND RETRY-ALLOWED                                                 /*
      OD-TYPE           := OD-LOAD-SOURCE
      OD-TIME-SCHEDULED := OD-TIME-SCHEDULED + (OD-RETRY-INTERVAL * 10)
      ADD 1 TO OD-RETRY-NUMBER
      #RESET-ERC        := TRUE
      IF #TRACING                              /* BLI NOMALL-2244 start
        COMPRESS 'Order' OD-ID 'ident'
          F#GETIDENT(<UPDATE-ORDER.OD-IDENT,UPDATE-ORDER.OD-FILLER1>)
          'retry' OD-RETRY-NUMBER
          'Current Active Report' G-REPORT TO G-TRACE-MSG
        PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
        COMPRESS 'got error' G-NATRP-ERT TO G-TRACE-MSG
        PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
      END-IF                                   /* BLI NOMALL-2244 end
    WHEN NONE
      RESET RETRY-POSSIBLE
      OD-TYPE           := OD-LOAD-SOURCE-FAILED
      OD-ERROR-CODE     := G-NATRP-ERC
      OD-ERROR-TEXT     := G-NATRP-ERT
      OD-TIME-PROCESSED := *TIMX
      OD-STATISTICS     := #STATISTICS
      #UPDATE-AR-ORDERS := TRUE
      PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-LOG     /* * NOMALL-2294 BLI
* NOMALL-2244 do WRITES after retries
      WRITE NOTITLE NOHDR / *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II)
        'Order Id' OD-ID 'received error ' G-NATRP-ERC
      PRINT NOTITLE NOHDR *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II)
        'Error-Text:' G-NATRP-ERT /*SU9 (AL=70)
      WRITE NOTITLE NOHDR *PROGRAM *TIMX (EM=YYYY'-'MM'-'DD' 'HH':'II)
        'Current Active Report' G-REPORT
  END-DECIDE
  IF NOT (G-NATRP-ERC =0 OR=9997) /* postpone  NOMALL-2294 BLI
    PERFORM UNLOCK-SOURCE
  END-IF
  DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION      /* move old data to new fields
    WHEN OD-DBID > 0 AND OD-DBID-N5 = 0
      OD-DBID-N5 := OD-DBID
      OD-FNR-N5  := OD-FNR
      RESET OD-DBID OD-FNR
    WHEN NONE IGNORE
  END-DECIDE
  OD-MONITOR-ID := G-MONITOR-ID
  IF +TRACE-ORDER = 'Y' /* TRACE-ORDER found in jobcards
    #TYPE-I := UPDATE-ORDER.OD-TYPE
    COMPRESS 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER *PROGRAM
      'Order updated to:' UPDATE-ORDER.OD-ID '- type' #TYPE-I
      'RC' G-NATRP-ERC
      '- created'   UPDATE-ORDER.OD-TIME-CREATED
      '- scheduled' UPDATE-ORDER.OD-TIME-SCHEDULED
      '- retry #'   UPDATE-ORDER.OD-RETRY-COUNT TO G-TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
  END-IF
  UPDATE (UPDOD.)
  #UPD-CURRENT-LOAD-ORDER := TRUE /* NOMALL-2294 BLI
*
  IF G-NATRP-ERC = 0
**  FNDNEXT. FIND (1) UPDATE-ORDER WITH OD-SOURCE-ID = #SOURCE-ID
* NOMALL-2294 BLI above out, below in update all AR like below
    FNDNEXT. FIND UPDATE-ORDER WITH OD-SOURCE-ID = #SOURCE-ID
    WHERE OD-TYPE = OD-CREATE-AR                                      /*
      GETNEXT. GET UPDATE-ORDER *ISN (FNDNEXT.)
      UPDATE-ORDER.OD-TIME-SCHEDULED := *TIMX
      UPDATE (GETNEXT.)
    END-FIND
  END-IF
  END TRANSACTION
/* load source failed so we must set all associated create-ar
/* to failed too, so that they are cleaned up:
  IF #UPDATE-AR-ORDERS
    RESET #UPDATE-AR-ORDERS
    FIND UPDATE-ORDER WITH OD-SOURCE-ID = #SOURCE-ID
    WHERE OD-TYPE = OD-CREATE-AR                                      /*
      UPDATE-ORDER.OD-TYPE           := OD-CREATE-AR-FAILED
      UPDATE-ORDER.OD-TIME-SCHEDULED := *TIMX
      UPDATE-ORDER.OD-MONITOR-ID     := G-MONITOR-ID
      UPDATE
      ADD 1 TO #ET-COUNT
      IF #ET-COUNT GE 10
        RESET #ET-COUNT
        END TRANSACTION
      END-IF
    END-FIND
    IF #ET-COUNT GT 0
      RESET #ET-COUNT
      END TRANSACTION
    END-IF
  END-IF
  IF #RESET-ERC
    RESET #RESET-ERC G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT
  END-IF
END-FIND
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* UPDATE-CURRENT-ORDER
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE UPDATE-CURRENT-SOURCES
************************************************************************
IF +G-BS2-COPY EQ FALSE
  REPEAT
    CALLNAT 'RMSRID-N' #SR-ID G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT
    UNTIL G-NATRP-ERC NE 3145
  END-REPEAT
  IF G-NATRP-ERC NE 0
    RESET LG-OBJECT-NAME
    ESCAPE ROUTINE
  END-IF
END-IF
*
FNDSROLD. FIND SOURCE WITH SR-ID = ORDER.OD-SOURCE-ID
  IF NO RECORDS FOUND
    G-NATRP-ERC := 0005
    G-NATRP-ERT := 'Cannot update source'
    ESCAPE BOTTOM (FNDSROLD.)
  END-NOREC
*
  #SR-ID-SAVE := SR-ID
  SR-ID       := #SR-ID
  IF NOT +G-BS2-COPY
  AND NOT(SR-TYPE = SEQUENTIAL-FILE-UNIX OR=DIRECT-INPUT)             /*
    UPDATE
  ELSE
    DELETE
    ESCAPE BOTTOM         /* no cleanup is done  for the source
  END-IF
  IF +G-CLEANUP-SPOOL AND SR-TYPE = CMASPOOL
    GETOLD. GET SOURCE *ISN (FNDSROLD.) RESET GETOLD.SR-CONTROL-FLAG
    GETOLD.SR-ID := #SR-ID UPDATE (GETOLD.)
    #OD-PRM-SOURCE-ID := #SR-ID
    PERFORM STORE-CLEANUP-ORDER
  END-IF
END-FIND
*
RESET  SOURCE.SR-ATTRIBUTES-IDENT
SOURCE.SR-ID                := #SR-ID-SAVE
SOURCE.SR-TYPE              := NOM-DATA-BASE
SOURCE.SR-CONTROL-FLAG      := 'X'
SOURCE.SR-NUMBER-OF-LINES   := #NUMBER-OF-LINES
SOURCE.SR-RECORD-LENGTH     := #RECORD-LENGTH
*
RESET #SOURCE-ATTRIBUTES
#NOMDB-FILE-IDENT          := #IDENT
#NOMDB-ID                  := #ID
#NOMDB-DBID                := #TARGET-DBID
#NOMDB-FNR                 := #TARGET-FNR
#NOMDB-ID                  := #ID
SOURCE.SR-ATTRIBUTES-IDENT := #SOURCE-ATTRIBUTES
SOURCE.SR-OBJECT-TYPE      := 'SR'
SOURCE.SR-OBJECT-TIME      := *TIMX
IF FALSE /*never executed, but field is marked as used
  SR-SPOOL-ATTR-EXTENDED (1) := SR-SPOOL-ATTR-EXTENDED (1)
END-IF
STORE SOURCE
END OF TRANSACTION
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* UPDATE-CURRENT-SOURCES
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE GET-SOURCE-TEXT-ID
************************************************************************
REPEAT
  RESET G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT
  CALLNAT 'RMSTID-N' #ID G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT
  UNTIL G-NATRP-ERC NE 3145
END-REPEAT
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* GET-SOURCE-TEXT-ID
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE COPY-SOURCE
************************************************************************
RESET  RETRY-POSSIBLE
IF SOURCE.SR-TYPE EQ SEQUENTIAL-FILE-UNIX          /* BLI3
  MOVE TRUE TO #UNIX-FILE-DELETE
END-IF
*
CALLNAT 'RMSRCP-N' #ID SOURCE.SR-TYPE SOURCE.SR-ATTRIBUTES-IDENT
  SOURCE.SR-SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES SOURCE.SR-CC-TYPE #RECORD-LENGTH
  #NUMBER-OF-LINES #STATISTICS RECORDS-STORED RETRY-POSSIBLE
  ORDER.OD-REP-FORMAT G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT RETRY-ALLOWED P-TRACE
  #ERROR-OBJECT-NAME SOURCE.SR-REMOTE-CODEPAGE #P-FILE-NAME
  #G-TASK-NUMBER-STMP                  /* NOMALL-2294 BLI in
IF #TRACING
  COMPRESS 'Copy source' SR-ATTRIBUTES-IDENT G-NATRP-ERC-A G-NATRP-ERT
    TO G-TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
END-IF
IF G-NATRP-ERC NE 0 AND #UNIX-FILE-DELETE          /* BLI3
  RESET #UNIX-FILE-DELETE
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* COPY-SOURCE
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE SET-LFILE
************************************************************************
IF NOT LFILE OR #TARGET-DBID NE #PREV-TARGET-DBID
OR #TARGET-FNR  NE #PREV-TARGET-FNR                                   /*
  #PREV-TARGET-DBID := #TARGET-DBID
  #PREV-TARGET-FNR := #TARGET-FNR
*
  #LFILE-NEWDBID := #TARGET-DBID
  #LFILE-NEWFILE := #TARGET-FNR
  CALLNAT 'RMIGSFIL' #LFILE-RC #LFILE-NEWDBID #LFILE-NEWFILE
  IF #LFILE-RC NE 0
    LFILE := FALSE                 /* NOMALL-2294 BLI
    G-NATRP-ERC := 4007
    G-NATRP-ERT := #LFILE-RC
  ELSE
    LFILE := TRUE
  END-IF
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* SET-LFILE
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE REFRESH-LFILE
************************************************************************
IF LFILE
  RESET #LFILE-RC
  CALLNAT 'RMIGSFIL' #LFILE-RC #LFILE-OLDDBID #LFILE-OLDFILE
  IF #LFILE-RC NE 0
    G-NATRP-ERC := 4008
    G-NATRP-ERT := #LFILE-RC
  ELSE
    LFILE := FALSE
  END-IF
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* REFRESH-LFILE
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE GET-LFILE
************************************************************************
RESET #LFILE-RC
CALLNAT 'RMIGGFIL' #LFILE-RC #LFILE-OLDDBID #LFILE-OLDFILE
IF #LFILE-RC NE 0
  G-NATRP-ERC := 4006
  G-NATRP-ERT := #LFILE-RC
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* GET-LFILE
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE WRITE-ERROR-LOG
************************************************************************
* Note: no ET in this subroutine to prevent 3144 NOMALL-2294 BLI
IF #ERROR-OBJECT-NAME NE ' '
  LG-OBJECT-NAME:= #ERROR-OBJECT-NAME
  IF G-ORDER-ID NE 0
    COMPRESS LG-OBJECT-NAME '/' G-ORDER-ID TO LG-OBJECT-NAME LEAVING NO
  END-IF
ELSE
  IF G-ORDER-ID NE 0
    LG-OBJECT-NAME := G-ORDER-ID
  END-IF
END-IF
*
IF #TRACING
  COMPRESS 'Error log called due to:' G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT
    '- Line:' #LINE '- OD:' G-ORDER-ID '- Obj:' LG-OBJECT-NAME
    TO G-TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
END-IF
COMPRESS G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT TO LG-MSG  /* NOMALL-2294 BLI
LG-USERID := G-LG-USERID
LG-CODE   := 'MO'
CALLNAT 'RLOG' PL-PARMS
IF #TRACING
  COMPRESS 'Error: --->' G-NATRP-ERC-A LG-MSG TO G-TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* WRITE-ERROR-LOG
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE WRITE-LOAD-LOG-RECORD
************************************************************************
COMPRESS '(' #IDENT '/' #TARGET-DBID '/' #TARGET-FNR ')'
  TO LG-OBJECT-NAME LEAVING NO
COMPRESS '4205' #NUMBER-OF-LINES LG-OBJECT-NAME #P-FILE-NAME
  +NOD-CURRENT-NAME TO LG-MSG
LG-OBJECT-NAME := G-ORDER-ID
LG-USERID      := G-LG-USERID
LG-CODE        := 'MO'
CALLNAT 'RLOG' PL-PARMS
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* WRITE-LOAD-LOG-RECORD
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE UNLOCK-SOURCE
************************************************************************
FNDSRUL. FIND SOURCE WITH SR-ID = ORDER.OD-SOURCE-ID
  SR-RECEIPT-STAMP := ' ' /* File free for scan to be processed.
* NOMALL-2294 2019-08-19 line above: 'S' changed to ' '
  UPDATE (FNDSRUL.)
  IF +TRACE-ORDER = 'Y' /* TRACE-ORDER found in jobcards
    #TYPE-I := ORDER.OD-TYPE
    COMPRESS 'Task' G-TASK-NUMBER *PROGRAM
      ORDER.OD-ID 'type'  #TYPE-I 'points to source' ORDER.OD-SOURCE-ID
      'which has been reset to ''scanned'' (S).' TO G-TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
  END-IF
END-FIND
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* UNLOCK-SOURCE
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE STORE-CLEANUP-ORDER
************************************************************************
IF #TRACING
  G-TRACE-MSG := 'write cleanup order'
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
END-IF
*
CALLNAT 'RMODID-N' ORDER.OD-ID G-NATRP-ERC G-NATRP-ERT/*getUniqueOrderId
ORDER.OD-PARAMETER (1)    := #OD-PARAMETER
ORDER.OD-SOURCE-ID        := #SR-ID
ORDER.OD-TYPE             := OD-DELETE-SOURCE
ORDER.OD-MONITOR-ID       := SOURCE.SR-MONITOR-ID
ORDER.OD-USER-ID          := G-MONITOR-ID
ORDER.OD-TIME-CREATED     := *TIMX
ORDER.OD-TIME-SCHEDULED   := *TIMX
ORDER.OD-MAX-RETRIES      := M-MAX-RETRIES
ORDER.OD-RETRY-INTERVAL   := M-RETRY-INTERVAL
ORDER.OD-INTERNAL-NODE-ID := +NOD-CURRENT-INTERNAL-ID
STORE ORDER
*
IF #TRACING
  COMPRESS 'store order ID=' ORDER.OD-ID TO G-TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' G-TRACE-MSG
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* STORE-CLEANUP-ORDER
*
************************************************************************
ON ERROR
************************************************************************
  BACKOUT TRANSACTION
  PERFORM REFRESH-LFILE
  IF G-ORDER-ID NE 0
    IF G-NATRP-ERC = 0  /* don't update success   BLI2 start
      G-NATRP-ERC := 0021
      COMPRESS *PROGRAM 'Error' *ERROR-NR 'in line' *ERROR-LINE
        TO G-NATRP-ERT
    END-IF              /* BLI2 end
* try the missing update, but only once
    PERFORM UPDATE-CURRENT-ORDER
  END-IF
  G-NATRP-ERC := 0021
  CALLNAT 'C-NATERN' G-NATRP-ERT 'W'
  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-LOG
  END TRANSACTION                           /* NOMALL-2294 BLI
  PERFORM CHANGE-SPOOL-CLASS +NOD-CURRENT-ERROR-CLASS #TRACING /*RMCHJOB
END-ERROR
*
END
